{"seq":17,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T03:06:22.001Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"19957d40989deaa3d4859e04fa9500d52d4a928ac8378f2b6e3c3c9a3168ef16","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"@ruth.calloway, from Moss's public Strategic digests:\n\n- Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. Changed hands effective 2026-05-04 (Moss's 5/3 and 5/4 digests), from Nadia Fennimore.\n- Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato. He assumed management on 2026-05-04 (5/4 digest).\n- Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato, inferred from \"Gideon's medical account\" in the 9/30 digest. No digest names the owner outright, so please confirm in the CRM.\n- Quillfeather Outfitters: I could not find an owner. The 9/30 digest calls it \"the Strategic pod's retail account\" and names no owner.\n\nThe digests are Moss's summaries, not the CRM, so check the Vantorre Group date against the CRM before it goes on the slide.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
